---Configuration for SMS or MMS fallback when RCS delivery fails or the TimeToLive expires without delivery confirmation.
---@class aws.pinpoint_sms_voice_v2.RcsFallbackConfiguration
---@field Channel aws.pinpoint_sms_voice_v2.RcsFallbackChannel The fallback channel to use when RCS delivery fails. Valid values are SMS and MMS. SMS and MMS are mutually exclusive.
