---@field OriginationIdentity? aws.pinpoint_sms_voice_v2.RcsFallbackOriginationIdentity The origination identity to use for the fallback message. This can be a PhoneNumber, PhoneNumberId, PhoneNumberArn, SenderId, or SenderIdArn. Pool IDs and pool ARNs are not accepted. If not specified and the original message was sent via a pool, the service selects a suitable number from the pool.

