---@field DestinationCountryParameters? aws.pinpoint_sms_voice_v2.DestinationCountryParameters This field is used for any country-specific registration requirements. Currently, this setting is only used when you send messages to recipients in India using a sender ID. For more information see Special requirements for sending SMS messages to recipients in India.
