---@field ProtectConfigurationId? aws.pinpoint_sms_voice_v2.ProtectConfigurationIdOrArn The unique identifier for the protect configuration.
---@field MessageFeedbackEnabled? boolean Set to true to enable message feedback for the message. When a user receives the message you need to update the message status using PutMessageFeedback.

